<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1665) <span class="when">Oct 16, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A showcase&#8217;s viewing on the studio&#8217;s own Macs, whoever made it.</b> In the Review Manager&#8217;s Studio Reviews, Viewing under any share opens how it was watched: every visit with its full record, the curve, heat, clips and the CSV, as the Mac that made it shows them. It&#8217;s read over the studio key, so only the studio&#8217;s own Macs see it.</li>
</ul>
